I come out of my house.
I walk towards the bus stop.
It is only nine in the morning.
But the sunshine outside is very harsh.
Today the air is also very hot.
Mumbai's heat is very sticky.
I feel very hot.
I arrive at the BEST bus stop.
There is a lot of sun at the bus stop.
There is a wall nearby.
There is a little bit of shade near the wall.
I stand in that shade.
A few other people are also standing there.
We all wait for the bus.
My bus will come soon.
I look towards the sky.
Will it really rain this evening?
